<title>ITALY: Crime-ridden Palermo twinned with Miami.</title>
<headline>Crime-ridden Palermo twinned with Miami.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palermo and Miami, two of the world's most vibrant but crime-ridden cities, were officially twinned on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Representatives from both cities attended a ceremony to mark the event in the Sicilian capital Palermo, where Mafia violence is a way of life.</p>
<p>The ceremony took place one day after top fashion designer Gianni Versace, born just across the Messina Straits in Reggio Calabria on the Italian mainland, was shot dead outside his mansion on Miami Beach.</p>
